### Create Upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/me/uploads
Authorization: {{PatientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file": "base64encodedFileHere",
  "title": "My File",
  "description": "File description",
  "visibility": 1  
}

### Get Upload by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/me/uploads/{{uploadId}}
Authorization: {{PatientToken}}

### Get All Uploads
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/me/uploads
Authorization: {{PatientToken}}

### Update Upload
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/me/uploads/{{uploadId}}
Authorization: {{PatientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete Upload
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/me/uploads/{{uploadId}}
Authorization: {{PatientToken}}

### Make Upload Public
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/me/uploads/{{uploadId}}/make-public
Authorization: {{PatientToken}}

### Make Upload Private
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/me/uploads/{{uploadId}}/make-private
Authorization: {{PatientToken}}
